"Elepta Agricultural Community is an abandoned farm for esoteric magical plants on Moon Thegund."
"Its sky is yellow and cloudy, its dirt hard and brown; it smells of sulfur and mint."
"It is dead silent."
"Its produce-packing warehouse has dusty robot arms, conveyor belts and a metal roof."
"The warehouse holds crates of dried fruit skins and a talking teleportation alcove."
"Overgrown marleck fields with irrigation stakes surround the warehouse."
"A shed holds rubber boots, tools and a drone cabinet."
"Waist-high sickly yellow grassland rings the farm, a three-hour walk from Joe's old lab."
"The lab is fifteen minutes away by armored vehicle."
"Joe's quests sent Alden there to pick marleck berries while he secretly evacuated lab staff."
"Lab staff set up a table and four bubble-wand shield devices in the warehouse."
"A demon swarm attacked the warehouse and knocked out its teleport alcove's runes."
